---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { chapters } from '../data/chapters.js';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Base
  home
  title="自学站"
  en="Robotics · 从刚体变换到轨迹规划"
  meta={[
    '<b>知识清单</b>　K00a–K26（M1–M8）',
    '<b>考试</b>　2026-11-11',
    '<b>体系</b>　李泽湘 / MLS',
  ]}
>
  <section>
    <div class="secno"><span class="n">00</span><span class="t">怎么用<em>HOW TO READ</em></span></div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p><b>每节的结构都一样。</b>正文按小标题与编号段落推进，讲到能算的地方就给一块画布：左边拖动，右边实时出矩阵。正文里的公式与面板里的数字是同一件事的两个视角，对不上就说明哪一步没懂。</p>
      <p><b>每节末尾三道题。</b>做题时可以直接拖上方面板核对，答错会告诉你错在哪、回正文哪一小节看。小测不记分，只用来找漏洞。</p>
      <p><b>离线可用。</b>公式与字体都随站点一起构建，<code>npm run preview</code> 或把 <code>dist/</code> 放到任意静态服务器即可读。页脚有「目录」可以回来。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="secno"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">目录<em>CONTENTS</em></span></div>
    <nav class="toc">
      {chapters.map((c) =>
        c.status === 'done' ? (
          <a class="row" href={`${base}/${c.slug}/`}>
            <span class="no">{c.no}</span>
            <span class="t">{c.title}<span class="kw">{c.kw}　{c.reg}</span></span>
            <span class="st done">已完成</span>
          </a>
        ) : (
          <div class="row todo">
            <span class="no">{c.no}</span>
            <span class="t">{c.title}<span class="kw">{c.kw}　{c.reg}</span></span>
            <span class="st">待写</span>
          </div>
        )
      )}
    </nav>
  </section>
</Base>
